questions.text:
Determine the equilibrium electron and hole concentrations inside a uniformly doped sample of Si under the following conditions:
(a) Room temperature, N_A ≪ N_D, N_D = 10^15/cm³;
(b) Room temperature, N_A = 10^16/cm³, N_D ≪ N_A;
(c) Room temperature, N_A = 9 × 10^15/cm³, N_D = 10^16/cm³;
(d) T = 450 K, N_A = 0, N_D = 10^14/cm³;
(e) T = 650 K, N_A = 0, N_D = 10^14/cm³.
